      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "data_truth"
      ],
      "text": "这说明云端长期是“在老 commit 上手动改/运行”,不是正常部署。这个教训也要写进去,以后不论是你还是其他agent接手,都得规范化。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_61c9cce6cd274f3eff3c_d48449ed16ccd3630742"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "4357c22d22024954a344ac6a02816e92c4cef32d94d69615bafd9df95acb7258",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.b8cf0ef375f1",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "真实 SHEIN 写操作仍必须走 dry-run、人工确认、审计回读和按动作 payload 适配器,不能静默执行。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_1f1b7ffe12af0a645ce9_4357c22d22024954a344"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "a9166fdf409cbd2d27b259660a01755b3875b5ca196521508122639ff4fc2ff6",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-12T14:02:50.960Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.identity.marketing.b46cae0f73b2",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity",
        "marketing",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "工作区 E:\\Codex WorkSpace\\Shein销售统计。你负责且只允许修改:[REDACTED OPAQUE TOKEN].mjs、[REDACTED OPAQUE TOKEN].ps1,并新增 [REDACTED OPAQUE TOKEN].mjs。不要修改其他文件,不要暂存/提交,不要碰当前存在的营销改动。目标:把现有每60秒轮询 watch 改为 Windows 事件驱动 fs.watch(session/memory note 变化触发),默认 debounce 15秒;启动时立即 reconcile;再保留默认60分钟低频兜底;兼容 --interval-seconds 但改作废弃的 reconcile alias;新增 --debounce-seconds、--reconcile-seconds、--log-file;状态只在 syncOnce 成功后推进,日志不得含 token。计划任务安装参数改成 DebounceSeconds=15、ReconcileMinutes=60,登录后常驻;保证 PowerShell 5 ASCII 安装脚本;测试用临时目录+fake API证明启动同步、事件触发去抖、短时间不轮询、无事件不重复POST、退出干净。自行运行定向测试。你不是独自在代码库,不得回退他人改动。最终列出改动与测试结果。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b8cdbe9ab8ad719b0d1e_a9166fdf409cbd2d27b2"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "5526b3bd11830addb3cdc7108a4f8e2d44b94c9f45e6009717c33cd74a8f1584",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.inventory.f479a6d27b4c",
